            </note>
            <note corresp="#d272-f2" n="2" xml:id="d272-f2-content">
                <p>The letter of January 22 is attached but not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d272-f3" n="3" xml:id="d272-f3-content">
                <p>Colby’s January 30 memorandum to
                        Kissinger is attached but not
                    printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d272-f4" n="4" xml:id="d272-f4-content">
                <p>Not attached. No record of Kissinger’s
